                    <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick a visible enemy unit within 12&quot; of this unit to be the target.</characteristic>
                    <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Roll a D3. On a 2+:
• Inflict an amount of mortal damage on the target equal to the roll.
• If the target unit&apos;s starting size was 1, subtract 1 from hit rolls for the target&apos;s attacks until the start of your next turn.</characteristic>
